  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DaBananaCat/Instrumental/refs/heads/1.21.7/assets/title.png\" alt=\"Instrumental Logo\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>引入多种乐器物品和方块，为你的世界增添音乐</p>\n<p>总共有 3 种物品（吉他、排笛和竖琴）以及 1 个方块（鼓）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/DaBananaCat/Instrumental/blob/1.21.7/assets/items.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Items\"></p>\n<p>通过注视你想要演奏的音符，然后右键点击来演奏乐器。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/DaBananaCat/Instrumental/blob/1.21.7/assets/holding_item.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Holding Item\"></p>\n<p>你甚至可以同时演奏两件乐器！（别问它是怎么实现的）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/DaBananaCat/Instrumental/blob/1.21.7/assets/two_items.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Holding Two Items\"></p>\n<p>你也可以与鼓进行交互来敲击它，蹲下则会敲击侧面。\n如果你只想敲击侧面，只需将其放置在釉陶上方即可</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/DaBananaCat/Instrumental/blob/1.21.7/assets/drum.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Drum Block\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fSir_BananaCat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e41722d0-0895-4da9-9b57-9085dc221a2f.webp\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting Ad\"></a></p>",
